@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 16
skinparam ArrowColor #738095
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
title 第 05a 阶段 · 控件与动画验证
left to right direction
rectangle "已完成\n文字宽度与数字居中\n统一圆角和反馈" as ui #D8F3DC
rectangle "已通过\n871 核心测试\n2096 界面断言\n92 个双语弹窗" as qa #D8F3DC
rectangle "已通过\n动画中间帧\n反向与快速切换\n真实拖动与撤销" as motion #D8F3DC
rectangle "当前\n安装／覆盖升级／卸载\n桌面图标与入口" as installer #FFF1C1
rectangle "待交付\n公开 GitHub Release\n安装包与源码" as release #E9EDF4
rectangle "待继续\nMac 功能细节\n大图、DPI 与实机时序" as parity #E9EDF4
ui --> qa
qa --> motion
motion --> installer
installer --> release
release --> parity
legend bottom
绿色：已验证　黄色：当前阶段　灰色：待完成
不以自动检查代替 Mac 实机一致性验收。
endlegend
@enduml
